','Progress Bar & Spectrum'=>'进度条与频谱样式','Progress bar with a live spectrum on its right (like Night Signal)'=>'左侧进度条 + 右侧实时频谱（同夜间信号）','Progress bar only (like Default)'=>'只有进度条（同默认）','Waveform progress bar: the loudness of the whole episode (like Pulse)'=>'波形进度条：静态显示整集各时间点的音量高低（同脉冲）','Applies to the player bar of every style. The live spectrum only moves for audio hosted on this site. The waveform is drawn by wavesurfer.js in the visitor\'s browser: the first time an episode is shown it downloads the whole audio file once (audio on another site needs CORS), then the browser keeps the waveform. Not drawn on phones, where the bar has no progress row.'=>'对所有风格的播放条生效。实时频谱只对本站托管的音频有跳动效果。波形由 wavesurfer.js 在访客的浏览器中绘制：某一集第一次显示时会完整下载一次音频（其他网站上的音频需要允许 CORS），之后由浏览器缓存波形。手机上播放条没有进度区域，因此不绘制。']];